@startuml
title Daily Rehearsal - State and Static Config Concept

entity "StaticConfig\n(Enum/Mapping)" as StaticConfig {
  * situationTypes
  * briefingByType
  * slotsByType
  * outfitsByType
  * simulationConfigByType
  * fallbackLinesByType
}

entity "Session" as Session {
  * sessionId
  --
  * status
  * situationType
  * attempt
  * partialContext
  * finalContext
  * missingSlotKeys
  * selectedOutfitId
  * currentTurn
  * conversationHistory
  * turnEvaluations
  * videoUrl
  * ticketId
}

entity "VideoAsset" as VideoAsset {
  * videoAssetId
  --
  * sessionId
  * publicUrl
  * contentType
  * durationMs
}

entity "Ticket" as Ticket {
  * ticketId
  --
  * sessionId
  * ticketPayload
  * downloadUrl
  * qrPayload
}

StaticConfig ||..o{ Session : initializes / validates
Session ||--o| VideoAsset : records
Session ||--o| Ticket : issues
Ticket ||--o| VideoAsset : links

note right of StaticConfig
상황 타입, slot 질문/default, outfit,
simulation 턴 수와 fallback 발화는
DB가 아니라 enum/정적 매핑으로 관리한다.
end note

note bottom of Session
하루용 단일 인스턴스 전시라면
인메모리 또는 단순 DB 하나로 충분하다.
end note

@enduml
